    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gɔy Kuɔth Nhial",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nhɔk Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu, kä tit min go̱o̱rɛ kɛnɛ ŋuɔ̱tkɛ kɛ luëëkɛ ni ciaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiɛtdɛ ni̱n ti̱ti̱ (min ci ruac ni ɣän kɛ gaatkun ti /ka̱n luek Kuɔth Nhial ni ŋa̱c ti kä /ka̱nɛ ni nɛn) luek Kuɔth Nhial Kuothdun kɛnɛ di̱t bumkädɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ nyuuth ni tin ga̱ykɛ naath kɛ lät tëë cɛ lät kä Pɛro kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tiɛtdɛ mëë cɛ lät kä rɛm I-jëp nikɛ jio̱o̱kɛ kɛnɛ thurbiɛɛlikɛ. Cɛ tëë i̱di ɛ nëë, /kenɛ kɛ muɔy Bar in Tith mëë ɛ kɛn i̱ guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ yɛ. Ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ näk mäni walɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tiɛtdɛ mëë cɛ lät kä yɛ däär dɔaar, mäni mɔ cia ben ɛn wa̱nɛ mi ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tiɛtdɛ mëë cɛ lät kä Da-tan kɛnɛ Ä-bi-ram gaat Eli-ab gat Rɛ-u-ben. /Ken piny rɔ lɛp a cɛ kɛ muɔl rɛy, nikɛ ji̱ dho̱rikiɛn kɛɛl, kɛ nyinkiɛn diaal mäni tin tëk däär gan I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cia kɛ nɛn kɛ waŋdun kɛn tëë diaal tëë ga̱ykɛ naath tëë ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ la̱t.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Puɔ̱th muɔ̱ɔ̱n gukä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Läthni luëëk ti ka̱mä ji̱ ti ɛn walɛ lɔcdu. Dɔ̱ɔ̱ bia tekɛ buɔ̱m mi bia wä kän ni mun in bia wä ciëŋ thi̱n, kui̱ Jɔr-dɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dɔ̱ŋ bia jääny kɛ ciaaŋ muun in ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ guɔ̱k guurikun, i̱ bɛ ka̱mkɛ kɛ karkiɛn, mun caak kɛnɛ liɛth tuar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn mun ɛ bia wä thi̱n ɔ, mɔ bia wä ciɛŋɔ, /cɛ cäät kɛ mun I-jëp ëë bä yɛn thi̱n, mëë la yɛn a piith, kä wacɛ jɛ ce̱tkɛ kak dɛɛni wal kɛ kui̱ kɔaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn mun in wiaa thi̱n kui̱ Jɔr-dɛn, ɛ mun löli kɛnɛ pääm, mi maath ni pi̱ ti dɛm ni nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ mun mi tiit Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun ɛ. Te waŋdɛ ni thi̱n ni tukä runä amäni thuɔ̱kdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä luɔ̱thɛ luek ɛ la̱tdä yɛ walɛ, ɛn ɣöö nhɔk Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu, kä palɛ kɛ lɔcdu kɛɛliw kɛnɛ ca̱ru kɛɛliw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bɛ yɛ moc kɛ nhiaal kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ nhiaal rueel kɛnɛ nhiaal ma̱y, kɛ ɣöö derɛ bɛlkun jek kɛnɛ liɛɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bɛ tɔ̱a̱rikun thiäŋ kɛ wal kɛ kui̱ ɣɔ̱ɔ̱kun. Kä bia mi̱th a bia ria̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tiɛtdɛ rɔ a lo̱ckun ci bi bath, a bia guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni kuth kɔ̱kiɛn, kä bia pal nikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wi̱i̱ jɛ la̱t bi kɛ̈c lɔaac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä yɛ, a bi pua̱a̱r thil nhiaal mi dɛ̈m. Kä bi mun thil dɛy, a bia cu tɛ̈ŋ kɛ pɛ̈th muun in gɔaa in bi Kuoth Nhial ɛ ka̱m yɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“La̱thɛ rieetkä ti̱ti̱ wi̱i̱dun kɛnɛ lɔcdun. Yianɛ kɛ ala nyuuth tetädun kɛnɛ nhiam kaandun röm nyiinkun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋi̱i̱cɛ kɛ gaatkun. Latdɛ kɛ mi ta̱yɛ nyuurä dho̱rikun, kɛnɛ mi ja̱lɛ dup, kɛ mi ta̱yɛ tɔ̱ɔ̱cä, kiɛ ta̱yɛ cuŋä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gɔ̱a̱rɛ kɛ tuduëlikun kɛnɛ wuɔ̱th thiekni dho̱rikun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dɔ̱ɔ̱ bi ni̱nkun kɛnɛ ni̱n gankun ŋuan mun ëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ guɔ̱k guurikun i̱ bɛ ka̱m kɛ ce̱tkɛ ni̱n kam puɔ̱rä nhial kɛnɛ piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi wä yɛn ŋuɔ̱t tin cä la̱t yɛ tit agɔaa, luek kä ɣöö nhɔk Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu, kɛnɛ ɣöö bia la̱t ni dupkɛ diaal kä bia käp ni jɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inɛ bi Kuoth Nhial dör diaal ɛ tɔ̱ joc nhiamdun, kä bia wi̱i̱ döri ti bum kä ŋuanikɛn kä yɛ ciɛŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mun ɛ ci pät cio̱kdun ɛ dɔanyɔ, ɛ duŋdun kä bɛ ka̱n ni däär dɔaar kɛnɛ Lɛ-ba-nɔn lɛnɛ ka̱n ni kiir Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh kui̱ käny ca̱ŋ a wä ni Bar in Bo̱r in te kam wi̱i̱ni kui̱ kony ca̱ŋ, ba duŋdun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ ram mi bi cuɔ̱ŋ nhiamdun. Bi Kuoth Nhial naath jak kä dual kɛ yɛ ce̱tkɛ mëë cɛ guɔ̱k yɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
